            "review_title": "Review at Banh Mi Zon",
            "review_text": "Adrienne D\nAuckland, New Zealand26 contributions\n0\nFresh and tasty banh mi\nSep 2018 • Couples\nGreat variety and very fresh banh mi. Inexpensive too. Delicious lunch! We ordered on one side of the road and then there is seating across the road and our lunch was brought over to us.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 19, 2018",
